WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.454
A project is just a folder.

2
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.741
Add a project, then open a folder on your computer.

3
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:16.437
Choose an agent, like Claude Code or Codex.

4
00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:22.010
Ask for a design first. The agent writes it, and opens it beside your chat.

5
00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:27.483
Then let it build. Preview it in the side panel.

6
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.653
Read the report in your Inbox.

7
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:32.453
Your turn.
